ar with the boys. But because of her high-profile treatment of others and her popularity, very few people accosted her. She also has an unexpected side of her love for cute things."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Under the alias of Ares, she plays with Kazuma in an online game, but neither of them knows their true name until it is revealed during her route."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her being mentioned / guest appearance in PRIMAL×HEARTS 2 will only happen if you have entered Mashiro / Alicetia's route. She will be the lover of Kazuma in Mashiro’s route."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c20423"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/79d7e2301418873b19e410f58eb17f0d4efc05b89ef26d064ab235776310e40d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ffd64320beb37fc2c49828c6153dba763de5aa1c75651e5418f80246afe53bdf.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"遥 そら","creatorId":"vndb:s195","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s195","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s195","name":"仙台 エリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:58150","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c20424","characterName":"天神平 陽姫","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c20424"},"originalCharacterName":"天神平 陽姫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"426"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"68"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"AA"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"146"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"70"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist's kouhai. Even though she's just a freshman, she managed to become Tendou-kai's student council president. Loves interesting things, she wants to make school life more interesting. Despite the fact that her appearance is petite, there is no doubt about her qualities as the president of Tendou-kai. She has creativity that goes beyond common sense, along with keen insight and leadership, through which she has gained a lot of support from the students. She cannot accurately understand love yet."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her guest appearance in PRIMAL×HEARTS 2 will only happen if you have entered Usagi’s route. She will be the lover of Kazuma in Usagi’s route."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c20424"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/32/321131f851bd0ae6d71158216492569d05a4c743e2a58e68775daf4a24f803a0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1c/1cccc14740760c7be87bf52977aacabf777acffd540038dda404ecda90652520.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鈴藤 ここあ","creatorId":"vndb:s1746","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1746","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1746","name":"小笠原 早紀","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:58155","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c20425","characterName":"駒形 ゆづき","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c20425"},"originalCharacterName":"駒形 ゆづき","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"105"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"C"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"81"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist's classmate and Gekka-kai's secretary. Cheerful and lively girl, she is responsible for the atmosphere in the Gekka-kai. Perhaps it is because she is like this, her social relationships is very wide, no matter which student council supporters, she is able to communicate with them. She will often take walks with her dog after school or work at the local coffee shop. When she is working, customers often come to see her because of her cute appearance and cheerful personality."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her guest appearance in PRIMAL×HEARTS 2 will only happen if you have entered Tateha's route. She will be the lover of Kazuma in Tateha's route."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c20425"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f6/f6e149465d5631fada7a9999e26a2c52f4391a81934f6164d12fa868c158a036.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f3/f34d9bdab11434b45a34463a154c36350570cbb651cffa56f1783775fe1a3e9c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藤森 ゆき奈","creatorId":"vndb:s280","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s280","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s280","name":"藤森 ゆき奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:58152","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c20426","characterName":"神流 歌奈","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c20426"},"originalCharacterName":"神流 歌奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"prima